OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry rules green belt works
OL,4,Amust be removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA developer has been ordered to halt
OL,7,Fwork on a holiday let site and remove
OL,8,Fbuildings, with 100 trees to be planted
OL,9,Fin their place, after their planning
OL,10,Fappeal failed.
OL,12,FIn May, the planning inspector ordered
OL,13,Fworks on "irreplaceable" woodland in
OL,14,FSilsden be destroyed and 300 trees
OL,15,Fplanted, but the developer appealed the
OL,16,Fdecision.
OL,18,FThey said work had taken place more
OL,19,Fthan four years before the notice was
OL,20,Fissued and was completed before they
OL,21,Facquired the site.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
