OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry rules green belt works
OL,4,Amust be removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut, during a four-day planning inquiry
OL,7,Fin July, planning inspector Paul
OL,8,FHocking said site photos and a visit he
OL,9,Fmade "directly contradicts the
OL,10,Fappellant's version of events".
OL,11,FBradford Council was given permission
OL,12,Fto reclaim "significant" costs.
